      - 2026-06-11-w6-quality-hardening.toon
  - audit_methodology: ~/.claude/skills/TACO-cross-audit/SKILL.md
  - previous_audit: taco-cross-audit-wave5-plugin (memory)
  - fix_in_pr: crates/kazuba-plugin-ocr/src/lib.rs (line 166, #[cfg(test)] ocr_metadata)
